## Agent summary

1. Task breakdown → confirm `Oreo/` branches → never edit read-only repos.
2. Code with module-matched style; add DbgCli when appropriate.
3. Refactors: minimal diff — preserve `do-while`/brace shape; wrap locks without re-indenting bodies.
4. netconf-polt locks/sysrepo: check execution plane (OPR-1 oper-push unlock-first; OPR-2 oper-get snapshot-only).
5. `bitbake` affected recipes; verify on OLT if needed.
6. Draft CR + commit message.
